OL,3,GNEWSATeen born without hair won't leave
OL,4,Ahome without wigs - now NHS has slashed
OL,5,Afunding
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Kizzi-Rae was referred back to her
OL,8,Flocal hospital from Salford Royal after
OL,9,Fa review led to patients living outside
OL,10,Fthe area being transitioned back to
OL,11,Fhealthcare providers near where they
OL,12,Flive.
OL,14,FNow a patient in Wrexham, she is only
OL,15,Feligible for two #100 vouchers a year,
OL,16,Fleaving the family #2,300 short.
